---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Base title="Affiliate disclosure | Freelance Stack">
  <PageHero title="Affiliate disclosure" lede="How this site makes money, and why it doesn’t change our picks." />
  <section class="page-body">
    <div class="container"><div class="prose">
      <p>Freelance Stack earns money through affiliate links. When you click a link and buy or sign up, the company may pay us a commission. You pay the same price either way.</p>
      <p>Affiliate links are marked and carry <code>rel="sponsored"</code>. Commissions do not decide what we write: each guide says who a tool suits and who should skip it, including tools we earn nothing from.</p>
      <p>Prices and features change. Check the vendor’s own page before you buy.</p>
    </div></div>
  </section>
</Base>
